Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libglib2.0-0, libgnome-desktop-4-2, libcolord-gtk4-1, libgoa-1.0-0, gnome-settings-daemon, accountsservice, libmalcontent-0-0, libgtop-2.0-11, libpwquality1, libnm0, libsecret-1-0, libpolkit-gobject-1-0, udisks2
Provides: gnome-control-center
Replaces: gnome-control-center
Conflicts: gnome-control-center
Description: GNOME Settings with Pulsar OS macOS customization for Debian.
 Custom build of gnome-control-center with Pulsar OS patches:
 Appearance panel with Live Wallpaper engine, Liquid Glass effect,
 macOS-style accent colors, and custom UI layout.
 Compiled from upstream GNOME source with the same overlay and patches
 used in the Arch Linux version of Pulsar OS.
